; What our kernel32.dll exports (docs/abi/windows.md W2): every name must be
; defined in kernel32.c. A program importing anything else is bound to one of
; ntdll's named stubs and says which when it calls it.
LIBRARY kernel32.dll
EXPORTS
CloseHandle
CreateEventA
CreateEventW
CreateMutexA
CreateMutexW
CreateSemaphoreA
CreateSemaphoreW
DuplicateHandle
ExitProcess
GetCurrentProcess
GetCurrentProcessId
GetCurrentThread
GetCurrentThreadId
GetEnvironmentVariableA
GetEnvironmentVariableW
GetErrorMode
GetLastError
GetModuleHandleA
GetModuleHandleW
GetProcAddress
GetProcessHeap
GetStdHandle
GetTickCount
GetTickCount64
HeapAlloc
HeapFree
HeapReAlloc
HeapSize
HeapValidate
OpenEventA
OpenEventW
OpenMutexA
OpenMutexW
PulseEvent
ReleaseMutex
ReleaseSemaphore
ResetEvent
SetErrorMode
SetEvent
SetLastError
SetUnhandledExceptionFilter
Sleep
SleepEx
TlsAlloc
TlsFree
TlsGetValue
TlsSetValue
WaitForMultipleObjects
WaitForMultipleObjectsEx
WaitForSingleObject
WaitForSingleObjectEx
WriteFile
